@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# @beep/todox
+
+Minimal Next.js app
+
+## Development
+
+```bash
+bun run dev
+bun run check
+bun run test
+bun run lint
+```
+
+This workspace is a runtime app, not a public TypeScript package. Keep app internals behind `@/*`; promote reusable contracts and domain code to slice or shared packages.
+
+## License
+
+MIT
